        "Html": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022public-flow\u0022\u003E\u003Csection class=\u0022public-flow-section public-section\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022public-section-frame\u0022\u003E\u003Cheader class=\u0022public-article docs-page-header\u0022\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022docs-title-actions\u0022 style=\u0022display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap\u0022\u003E\u003Ch1\u003EWelcome to your cCoder platform\u003C/h1\u003E\u003Cdiv class=\u0022docs-title-action-links\u0022 style=\u0022display:flex;flex-wrap:nowrap;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;gap:.75rem;margin:.25rem 0 0 auto;white-space:nowrap\u0022\u003E\u003Ca class=\u0022btn btn-primary btn-lg\u0022 href=\u0022/Admin\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022k-icon k-i-gear\u0022\u003E\u003C/span\u003EOpen administration\u003C/a\u003E\u003Ca class=\u0022btn btn-secondary btn-lg\u0022 href=\u0022https://ccoder.co.uk/Documentation\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noreferrer\u0022\u003E\u003Cspan class=\u0022k-icon k-i-book\u0022\u003E\u003C/span\u003ERead the documentation\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\u003Cp class=\u0022public-copy\u0022\u003EYour new platform is ready, and this is the starting point for shaping it around the people, content and processes it will support.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/header\u003E\u003Carticle class=\u0022public-article\u0022\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EEverything begins in administration\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOpen the administration area to configure the application, manage users and access, and explore the capabilities included in your baseline.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESet up the application experience, themes and reusable content.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EManage platform users, roles and identity security.\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EExplore documents, workflows, shared resources and operational tools.\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EBuild from a working foundation\u003C/h2\u003E